{"id":"leetcode-3701","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Compute Alternating Sum","summary":"Given an integer array, calculate the alternating sum by adding elements at even indices and subtracting elements at odd indices.","statement":"Given an integer array, calculate the alternating sum by adding elements at even indices and subtracting elements at odd indices.","constraints":["Add values at even zero-based indices.","Subtract values at odd indices.","Return the resulting alternating sum."],"topics":["arrays","sums"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"alternating_index_sum","parameters":[{"name":"nums","annotation":"list[int]","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"int","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def alternating_index_sum(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def alternating_index_sum(nums):\n    return sum(value if i%2==0 else -value for i,value in enumerate(nums))\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def alternating_index_sum(nums):\n    return sum(value if i%2==1 else -value for i,value in enumerate(nums))\n","def alternating_index_sum(nums):\n    return sum(value if i%2==0 else value for i,value in enumerate(nums))\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(n)","target_space_complexity":"O(1)","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Enumerate values with zero-based indices.","Use a positive sign on even indices and a negative sign on odd indices.","Add every signed contribution.","The parity rule directly matches the alternating-sum definition."],"editorial":"The parity rule directly matches the alternating-sum definition.","tests":[{"id":"lc-3701-1","arguments":[[1,3,5,7]],"expected":-4,"comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"One minus three plus fi